  "description": "Here it comes! Adult BL Short Story Collection Season 3! ~Blue Boyz~ Based on \"Sorrow,\" this collection of hot adult BL short stories with a sad ending unlike anything you've ever seen before is here!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n1-4. **Pado, Hayan** (파도, 하얀) \\[Gwang-Ko\\]\n5-7. **Yunikonui Sungyeolbanji** (유니콘의 순결반지) \\[Dong-Hwa\\]\n8-11. **Segyeui Kkeuteseo Nareul Meogeojwo** (세계의 끝에서 나를 먹어줘) \\[Mullakjwi x Naljo\\]\n12-14. **Nae Doryeonnimui Gyeolhonsik** (내 도련님의 결혼식) \\[Jongjong x Jandaeng\\]\n15-17. **Naui Sullyegaek** (나의 순례객) \\[Mullakjwi x NGun\\]\n18-21. **Nugunga Urireul Biaera Bureuljieonjeong** (누군가 우리를 비애라 부를지언정) \\[Mullakjwi x Mulmeong\\]\n22-23. **Kkumeul Kkaeji Marajwo** (꿈을 깨지 말아줘) \\[Jongjong x XL\\]\n24-26. **Nuneul Gamaya Boineun Neo** (눈을 감아야 보이는 너) \\[Jongjong x Studio 37.5\\]\n27-30. **Tong Sogui Namchin** (통 속의 남친) \\[Meommeo\\]",
